{
  "slug": "socialpro-szamlazz",
  "name": "Socialpro Szamlazz",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Issue, cancel, and fetch Hungarian invoices via the szamlazz.hu Agent API — directly from │Claude Code. VAT-aware, with NAV taxpayer lookup and automatic partner cache. Cross-platform.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `szamlazz` (Hungarian invoice issuance via the szamlazz.hu Agent API — create invoices, cancel with storno, generate proforma (díjbekérő), fetch…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install socialpro-szamlazz@claude-community` from `socialproKGCMG/socialpro-szamlazz`.",
